# Generated whole-repo source dumps.
#
# PROJECT_SOURCE.md was one of these, and it published the live service_role key
# — the credential that bypasses RLS on every table, including patient medical
# history — to this public repo on 2026-07-26. Anything that concatenates the
# whole tree will sweep up a .env value sooner or later, so these stay untracked.
PROJECT_SOURCE.md
*_SOURCE.md
project-source.*

# Leftover isolated agent worktrees (Agent tool, isolation: "worktree")
.claude/worktrees/
